    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/eb5a1f0e42cd4d13031644d00bc0cd45.poster.avif?t=1724914157\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/eb5a1f0e42cd4d13031644d00bc0cd45.webm?t=1724914157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/eb5a1f0e42cd4d13031644d00bc0cd45.mp4?t=1724914157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A classic RPG about one girl's journey to save the people of the Omega Empire! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10+ hours of gameplay <br></li><li>A JRPG from veteran doujin creators </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/00fc642bfcc500d5cfcabd71da5e1c2e.avif?t=1724914157\" /></span><br>A skilled assassin who boasts a 100% success rate for assassination missions. She is known as the Black Reaper because of her hair color and reliable assassination record. Although her skin and hair color suggest that she is from the East, she has no memory of her birthplace.<br><br>She has no particular interest in other people, especially the opposite sex. However, when she was once severely wounded while on a mission as a novice, she gave her heart to the young man who saved her. They became lovers, although she has been concealing the fact that she is an assassin from him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2>The people of the Omega Empire suffer under the oppressive rule of Emperor Duke. Egregious violence\u2014and possibly death\u2014awaits anyone attempting to defy the crushingly heavy taxes\u2026<br><br><br>The population at large live in fear of their Imperial overlords. However, a brave few have risen up to destroy the Empire\u2014the resistance movement \u03a8 (Psi), headed by the renegade leader Edgar.<br><br>On the surface, they work as jacks-of-all-trades, helping citizens in need. Below the surface, the organization's main activity is &quot;purging&quot;\u2014that is to say, assassinating\u2014Imperial officials and criminals alike. Anyone who brings suffering to the populace could be next.<br><br>One of the members of \u03a8 is a beautiful, dark-haired woman who hardly looks the part of an assassin. With her beloved sword Oborozuki, which she received from Edgar, in hand, Hazuki is ready to face the empire once again...",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/eb5a1f0e42cd4d13031644d00bc0cd45.poster.avif?t=1724914157\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/eb5a1f0e42cd4d13031644d00bc0cd45.webm?t=1724914157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/eb5a1f0e42cd4d13031644d00bc0cd45.mp4?t=1724914157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A classic RPG about one girl's journey to save the people of the Omega Empire! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10+ hours of gameplay <br></li><li>A JRPG from veteran doujin creators </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386350/extras/00fc642bfcc500d5cfcabd71da5e1c2e.avif?t=1724914157\" /></span><br>A skilled assassin who boasts a 100% success rate for assassination missions. She is known as the Black Reaper because of her hair color and reliable assassination record. Although her skin and hair color suggest that she is from the East, she has no memory of her birthplace.<br><br>She has no particular interest in other people, especially the opposite sex. However, when she was once severely wounded while on a mission as a novice, she gave her heart to the young man who saved her. They became lovers, although she has been concealing the fact that she is an assassin from him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2>The people of the Omega Empire suffer under the oppressive rule of Emperor Duke. Egregious violence\u2014and possibly death\u2014awaits anyone attempting to defy the crushingly heavy taxes\u2026<br><br><br>The population at large live in fear of their Imperial overlords. However, a brave few have risen up to destroy the Empire\u2014the resistance movement \u03a8 (Psi), headed by the renegade leader Edgar.<br><br>On the surface, they work as jacks-of-all-trades, helping citizens in need. Below the surface, the organization's main activity is &quot;purging&quot;\u2014that is to say, assassinating\u2014Imperial officials and criminals alike. Anyone who brings suffering to the populace could be next.<br><br>One of the members of \u03a8 is a beautiful, dark-haired woman who hardly looks the part of an assassin. With her beloved sword Oborozuki, which she received from Edgar, in hand, Hazuki is ready to face the empire once again...",
